      <activity id="2cf21139-f478-56dd-8b16-0228a9fa7327" activityNameId="8ff0ab0d-bb3d-5c7b-952c-d962217fdd5c" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Connector, clamp connection, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Connector, clamp connection, at plant
The data represent a current clamp type connector for three wires used in the electronics industry in general. Material data are taken from product sheets of a producer. The energy demand for the production is from literature. Infrastructure and transport efforts rough estimations. The dataset represents 1 kg of clamp type connectors with a weight of 9 gram/unit.;
UUID: c97305c1-c9f3-3a9a-9a7a-614d4c30fc89
This dataset covers raw material input, energy consumption, infrastructure and transport efforts for the production of clamp type connectors.
Location: Data represent a global valuable composition of 3-wired clamp type connectors.
Technology: average connector production technology, based on literature and assumptions
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: literature 
Extrapolations: see Geography &amp; Technology
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_c97305c1-c9f3-3a9a-9a7a-614d4c30fc89.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
